title: changeset marker
pid: 487c0e8a-326e-4b2b-aaa3-99c471a4a1d1
body: |2-
  A childless change viewnode ('ChangeViewnode::ChangesetMarker') that
  stands for a set of changes recorded in its parent's file, and carries
  their derived processed state. There are two kinds: the content changeset
  marker ("its content changed") and the relRepo changeset marker ("some
  content relationships changed skgrepo").
